    {"type":"text","id":"bannerT","x":76,"y":522,"width":848,"height":62,"text":"Once proof-search is cheap, the bottleneck MOVES to the under-tooled axis (>80% of failures are misformalization).\nFix: diversity-search over formalizations — formalize N → compile all → audit-select, on HELD-OUT theorems.","originalText":"Once proof-search is cheap, the bottleneck MOVES to the under-tooled axis (>80% of failures are misformalization).\nFix: diversity-search over formalizations — formalize N → compile all → audit-select, on HELD-OUT theorems.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#7c2d12","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":3131,"version":1,"versionNonce":3131,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"banner","lineHeight":1.35}
